{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b65b3ddcfc83302b94f1e6dc4c23a17f449b61ddc11e739a876a9a971f18ac38", "ja": "（天体公演は、大好評で幕を閉じ……\n麗花たちアクアリウスに、仕事の依頼があった）", "zh": "（天体公演在一片好评中落下帷幕……水瓶座的丽花她们也接到了工作委托。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1001_p", "source_sha256": "68409d9e437d14f9103fbbc66f7e017c7d7b78ebaeef50e279fa1698b2e8be70", "ja": "（劇場のライブ風景を、ネット配信するという企画。\nなかなか熱いものになりそうだな……！）", "zh": "（把剧场的演出现场通过网络直播的企划。感觉会变得相当火热啊……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "47461d6ad146d195df549eedfef8f6a9cc561628045ac665b5f4958a3be5d292", "ja": "きゅっきゅっきゅ。キレイに磨いて、\nリボンをつけて……うん、バッチリ♪", "zh": "啾啾啾。擦得干干净净，再系上蝴蝶结……嗯，完美♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "a13e7ba95120780de71037dcc8ad51b0e9091a648a52783beb7d1bd5cf896809", "ja": "かわいくなったね、ピッくん。\n今日は一緒にがんばろう！", "zh": "变可爱了呢，小镐。  \n今天一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6860720bb126ac39b6759b5e48b9f6450a4b74728033f1c27cb581c2e348213f", "ja": "麗花、お疲れさま。……そこのピッケル、\nまさかステージに持っていくつもりじゃないよな？", "zh": "丽花，辛苦了。……那个镐子，你该不会打算带到舞台上去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "6ed58aee6b44138a898f17ef66a15524354c06de6d66952ef51a5a0af8c4ff55", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです♪\nもちろん、一緒に出ますよ♪　どうかしましたか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，辛苦了♪  \n当然要一起登台呀♪ 怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1006_048rei", "source_sha256": "7d5b8ef010b33df5e27416917a9728da3eea0b47d1c004061d50dde71047450e", "ja": "今日はステージの様子をネット配信するって聞いたので\nピッくんも、いーっぱいおめかししたんです♪", "zh": "听说今天要在网上直播舞台现场，\n所以皮酱也精心打扮了一番♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a11dbe34396a0616f42f7fb41ffe54191963eb70b7ad7389c367bfdd8803652b", "ja": "いや、ピッくんはアイドルじゃないから……\nおめかししても、ステージにあげるわけには……。", "zh": "不是，小皮又不是偶像……\n就算精心打扮了，也不能带上台啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "2704b422b989de92e5c5799b0df6de50d81021e69c907e115b58668304e5f003", "ja": "えっ、ダメですか？　ピッくんが一緒なら、\nもっと楽しいステージになると思ったんですけど……。", "zh": "诶，不行吗？我还以为有小皮一起的话，舞台会变得更有趣呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "55ca425e66c50ca4e067570394c9e2eabc53f612ec72376b1fca48f735754c1d", "ja": "ひとりで待ちぼうけなんて、\nなんだかかわいそう……ぐすん。", "zh": "一个人苦等着，也太可怜了……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1010_p", "source_sha256": "bda251d01b3772054dbfb0a4738c9a0990426d87b9d1ebee6c6aedfd912c5ae7", "ja": "……わかった。ピッくんは俺と一緒にいてもらう。\nそして一緒に、麗花達のステージを観せてもらうよ。", "zh": "……知道了。那就让小皮和我待在一起吧。\n然后，我们一起去看丽花她们的舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "f4f4016185d89b85ea935f59c7135efcba6478a1ed30f482a4ef2e4194aa4c9b", "ja": "{$P$}さんが、ピッくんと一緒に？", "zh": "{$P$}先生要和皮仔在一起？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1012_p", "source_sha256": "15cd957144de5393b01b5214d2e2dbf3289eb4a630714349080646ac8176d841", "ja": "うん。きっとピッくんも、ステージに立つより、\n麗花たちのステージが観たいはずだ。そう思わないか？", "zh": "嗯。皮克也一定比起登上舞台，更想观看丽花她们的舞台。你不这么觉得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1013_048rei", "source_sha256": "11a0ad79d823886d7b19826b4b6d023fbb20e42bc373a45c1695e13282313215", "ja": "私たちのステージを……そっか。\nそうかもしれませんね！", "zh": "我们的舞台……原来如此。\n也许真的是这样呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "0381bc04ac5cbb3aae5108bb1ff8984fdee6a087c518764146430e3b46199665", "ja": "そんなにピッくんの気持ちがわかるなんて、\nさすが、ピッケルデューサーさんです♪", "zh": "居然这么了解小皮的心情，\n不愧是皮克制作人♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1015_staff", "source_sha256": "92360d4edd35d01e8cc73a85dd00ddbf7c7fe14ef940ba1c066a6b85dd96cfcb", "ja": "北上さん、お願いしまーす！", "zh": "北上小姐，拜托啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "d3848e8d52916069af97840def366dc396b00bafc201dba0dc5a0e1305fd3047", "ja": "あっ、もう時間みたい。\nそれじゃあ私、行ってきますね！", "zh": "啊，好像到时间了。\n那我先走啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "19999fdc4c08c1252a243be2e7d76fdefc0b3c0059001bf07ca625e9f2d75c10", "ja": "{$P$}さん。ピッくんと一緒に、\n私たちのこと、応援しててくださいね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生。要和皮酱一起，\n为我们加油打气哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1018_p", "source_sha256": "d558a9679d1c52e7f12fe102e7587ae1f4466c44840c18431a973883c15a7af7", "ja": "（その後、麗花は情感のこもった素晴らしい歌声で\n曲を歌いきり、リバイバルライブは大成功に終わった）", "zh": "（之后，丽花用饱含感情的美妙歌声唱完了整首歌，复出演唱会圆满落幕。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0143_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0143_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ed4c5d0479b97a0fae48ccea714c87f399b2b4a8bdae0d51b76f00b0ff543f2f", "ja": "（よかったな、麗花。\nピッくんも、俺の隣で喜んでる……気がする！）", "zh": "（太好了，丽花。\n感觉皮酱也在我身边替她高兴……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
